  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Pick one route, finish one project and show it to two people in the field. Then read ten live notices and apply or pitch a small client.
  </p>
  <p>
    A specialist can look at your strengths, finances and goals with you. A sensible first step is <a href="/services/career-counselling-and-career-guidance/student-career-guidance/">student career guidance</a>. The aim is a high-income skill portfolio and an earlier path to financial freedom.
  </p>

  <p>
    For role areas and a twelve-week plan, read <a href="/blog/college-degrees/job-oriented-courses-for-mechanical-engineering-students-india/">job oriented courses for mechanical engineering students</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For routes, a budget check and a twelve-week test plan, read <a href="/blog/college-degrees/mtech-ms-gate-or-a-job-after-btech-ece-eee-and-cse-how-to-decide-india/">MTech, MS, GATE or a job after BTech</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For the control loop, a PLC practice ladder and safety habits, see <a href="/blog/career-options/industrial-automation-plc-scada-and-instrumentation-careers-india/">industrial automation, PLC, SCADA and instrumentation</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For a load list exercise and the service disciplines, see <a href="/blog/career-options/electrical-design-mep-and-hvac-engineering-careers-india/">electrical design, MEP and HVAC</a>.
  </p>

  <p>
    For the plant to meter chain and a utility exam approach, see <a href="/blog/career-options/electrical-power-systems-and-utilities-careers-india/">electrical power systems, transmission and utilities</a>.
  </p>

